# TimeQuest

Single-machine local-first desktop app (Tauri 2 + React 19 + SQLite). No accounts, no cloud.

## Rules

- Progress = sum(actual_units); never maintain a separate completed counter.
- Reschedule keeps the original session as `rescheduled`; do not delete history.
- XP only for actual_units; idempotent complete (no double XP / logs).
- React never opens SQLite directly — use Tauri commands.
- Put XP/level/streak/achievement math in `src/lib/gamification.ts` as pure functions with tests.
- Aggregate stats in SQL/Rust, not in the frontend.
- Brand strings come from `src/lib/constants.ts` (`APP_NAME`, etc.).
- Theme: dark base + sprint orange accent. No purple gradients.
